# Template upgrade scratch files. `.fastapi-fullstack.json` itself IS committed —
# these two are transient: the guide says to commit your resolved conflicts, and a
# blanket `git add -A` would otherwise sweep the pending manifest into that commit,
# only for `upgrade finalize` to delete it again a minute later.
.fastapi-fullstack.json.pending
.fastapi-fullstack.json.candidate

# Project specific
